-- title:
--   Exact cutoff jump integral as a jump series
-- statement:
--   Use countable positive physical jump support and the atomic measure and Dirac integral identities. Rewrite the spatial derivative on positive times and reindex the series by the horizon.
-- source:
--   Kyprianou (2006), Chapter 4, Theorem 4.3.

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_Kyprianou_Ch02_LargeJumpProcess
import Definitions.Def_Kyprianou_Ch02_CompensatedSmallJumpBand
import Definitions.Def_LeanLevy_Processes_LevyProcess
